{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given number is a Woodall number.\n    A Woodall number follows the formula n * 2^n - 1 for a positive integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number <= 0:\n        return False\n\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = n * (2**n) - 1\n        if woodall_candidate == number:\n            return True\n        elif woodall_candidate > number:\n            # If the calculated Woodall number exceeds the target,\n            # further increments of n will only produce larger numbers.\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
