{"task_id": "Mbpp/125", "solution": "def find_length(binary_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between the count of '0's and '1's\n    in any substring of the given binary string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not binary_string:\n        return 0\n\n    # Map '0' to 1 and '1' to -1. The problem then becomes finding the maximum\n    # absolute sum of any contiguous subarray in the transformed array.\n    # This sum represents (count_of_0s - count_of_1s).\n    transformed_arr = []\n    for char in binary_string:\n        if char == '0':\n            transformed_arr.append(1)\n        else:  # char == '1'\n            transformed_arr.append(-1)\n\n    # Kadane's algorithm to find the maximum subarray sum\n    max_so_far = transformed_arr[0]\n    current_max = transformed_arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, len(transformed_arr)):\n        current_max = max(transformed_arr[i], current_max + transformed_arr[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n    # Kadane's algorithm to find the minimum subarray sum\n    min_so_far = transformed_arr[0]\n    current_min = transformed_arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, len(transformed_arr)):\n        current_min = min(transformed_arr[i], current_min + transformed_arr[i])\n        min_so_far = min(min_so_far, current_min)\n\n    # The result is the maximum of the absolute values of the max and min sums found.\n    # This covers cases where '0's are dominant (positive sum) or '1's are dominant (negative sum).\n    return max(abs(max_so_far), abs(min_so_far))"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/130", "solution": "def max_occurrences(input_list: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Find the item with maximum frequency in the given list.\"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input list cannot be empty.\")\n\n    frequency_map = {}\n    for item in input_list:\n        frequency_map[item] = frequency_map.get(item, 0) + 1\n\n    max_item = None\n    max_frequency = -1\n\n    for item, frequency in frequency_map.items():\n        if frequency > max_frequency:\n            max_frequency = frequency\n            max_item = item\n    return max_item"}
