{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(list1, list2, list3):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts three parallel lists into a list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each dictionary in the output list will have the structure {list1_element: {list2_element: list3_element}}.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not (len(list1) == len(list2) == len(list3)):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input lists must have equal length\")\n\n    result_list = []\n    for i in range(len(list1)):\n        outer_key = list1[i]\n        inner_key = list2[i]\n        value = list3[i]\n        \n        # Create the nested dictionary: {outer_key: {inner_key: value}}\n        nested_dict = {outer_key: {inner_key: value}}\n        result_list.append(nested_dict)\n        \n    return result_list"}
